{"data":{"codec":"utf8","content_ref":"inline:The $846 flat-rate error (SRC_005) inherits from the $1269 universal-overtime error (SRC_006) as a complementary failure mode: SRC_006 applies the 1.5× premium to all hours, while SRC_005 applies it to none, both ignoring the threshold-bounded mechanism of SRC_013. It is refuted if the pay calculation is confirmed to be a piecewise function with a discontinuity at 40 hours.","id":"89b4a794edf6031db3d23739bc45ba6a4c64633ce0b3a1411813c6ca0e32b44a","interface":{"commitments":["hv-floor@2a45b7988522","lineage-ref@4796ddef8e78","relation-form@578e42df713e"],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"190d009cd72e00fbb3dc1ecbd265cb7adf1d3ae039633692ddc7ca6427a1faa8"},{"role":"dependence","target":"8009aaf8b86019ab6b214a7c8eaa3050ad1690df2ee5b1a619da7f9d8bb7d03e"},{"role":"dependence","target":"81839e92e145d819d054f0962772e584eb980bad7cefeeef65b4e425e00f2ac7"},{"role":"dependence","target":"8855df36b2d51b25417756775b677498254ded7ccb5e6a68749fa2e45cf02053"},{"role":"dependence","target":"abcfb05e5b80c0829e2e9901f4bf27462ba44e8701a3eba0640eff2b882c840d"},{"role":"dependence","target":"41e52b9c5a9c1dd86ba4b16afee4f20385d84cb6605d676057dbdc19ae5ea66c"}]},"provenance":{"event_seq":716,"role":"conjecturer","school":"school-3"},"warrants":[]},"id":"89b4a794edf6031db3d23739bc45ba6a4c64633ce0b3a1411813c6ca0e32b44a","schema":"artifact"}